# Same columns as library_notes.py: slug, appid, name, genres, summary, camera, core loop, ui and feel, information,
# art, audio, lesson, DNA axes (0-9: tempo, challenge, expression, structure, social, systems, chance, session length),
# information mix (0-9, sums to 10: diegetic, spatial, meta, overlay, none), HUD % of screen, confidence.
# Waves are ordered by how much each game can teach Abbie's World (kid-friendly, building, worlds that react).

